# Browser file system implementation over the Origin Private File System (OPFS). Forwards to the linked `io` runtime shim, which drives navigator.storage.getDirectory(). OPFS is asynchronous, so every operation (including existence) is async. Internal: reached only through the public file API.

dock load
  load <global:io>, name io

task read-file
  note async
  take path, like text
  like text
  send back
    call io/file-read
      read path

task write-file
  note async
  take path, like text
  take data, like text
  send back
    call io/file-write
      read path
      read data

task read-file-bytes
  note async
  take path, like text
  like bytes
  send back
    call io/file-read-bytes
      read path

task write-file-bytes
  note async
  take path, like text
  take data, like bytes
  send back
    call io/file-write-bytes
      read path
      read data

task append-file
  note async
  take path, like text
  take data, like text
  send back
    call io/file-append
      read path
      read data

task remove-file
  note async
  take path, like text
  send back
    call io/file-remove
      read path

task copy-file
  note async
  take from, like text
  take to, like text
  send back
    call io/file-copy
      read from
      read to

task move-file
  note async
  take from, like text
  take to, like text
  send back
    call io/file-move
      read from
      read to

task file-exists
  note async
  take path, like text
  like boolean
  send back
    call io/file-exists
      read path
